    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      403.51,
      286.68,
      494.24
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: 3/4/71. Land Min. Ref No.: LD/05/2006/HA/490. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of Land Acquisition Act No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      495.68,
      286.7,
      586.16
    ],
    "text": "Two allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 282 and 283 in Final Village Plan No. 849, Supplimentary No. 06 Sheet No. 06 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys Kurunegala, situated in the village called Udahorombuwa in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 565 of Madure Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Rideegama in Kurunegala District of the Northwestern Province and more fully described as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.28,
      599.12,
      198.6,
      632.28
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE 01. Lot No. 282",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      632.51,
      286.68,
      670.16
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Hendillehena, Hedillehena alias Hendillewatta; Claimant: Ms. Pallegedara Premawathie, Udahorombuwa; Extent: 0.0042 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      318.96,
      346.88,
      386.28,
      357.0
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 283",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      357.23,
      539.88,
      406.4
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Hendillehena, Hedillehena alias Hendillewatta, Pansalewatta; Claimant: Mr. Hendille-gedara Somadasa, Udahorombuwa; Extent: 0.0271 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      408.06,
      539.87,
      534.08
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Rideegama Divisional Secretariat on 20th July, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 13th July, 2016 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      535.5,
      539.83,
      569.6
    ],
    "text": "All deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
